0E5 EQUATE P0CON     0E6 EQUATE P1CON     0E8 EQUATE P2CONH    0E9 EQUATE P2CONL
0EA EQUATE P3CONH    0EB EQUATE P3CONL
0EC EQUATE P3INT     0ED EQUATE P3PND     0EE EQUATE P3STA     0F2 EQUATE TACNT
0F3 EQUATE TBCNT     0F4 EQUATE TADATA    0F5 EQUATE TBDATA    0F6 EQUATE TACON
0F7 EQUATE TBCON     0F8 EQUATE WTCON     0F9 EQUATE LCON      0FA EQUATE FDCON
0FB EQUATE CLKMOD    0FD EQUATE BTCNT     0FE EQUATE EMT       0FF EQUATE IPR

END-EQUATES \ 42 equates
